+\section*{4. Complete executable membranes in Vox}
+The complete process path expresses parameters as IMASM numerals, bakes them
+into a static executable, lifts executable operations and data into a saved
+IMASM module, and runs that module through Vox.
+The saved module carries symbols, embedded data and lifted instructions.
+A numeral string supplies the input payload; the complete module carries the
+executable membrane with that payload.
